Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.37,0:00:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Au tour du fer, celui\Nqui a fait marcher VKS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}À sa surface, la composante du\N{\c&H3468EB&}champ{\c&HF7F4F2&} qui la traverse est continue,
